        "prompt": "再加一个收支分类统计卡片，能一眼看到总收入、总支出和结余",
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='zh-CN'><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><meta http-equiv='Content-Security-Policy' content='default-src &#39;none&#39;; style-src &#39;unsafe-inline&#39;; script-src &#39;unsafe-inline&#39;; img-src data: blob:'><title>轻记账 · 统计版</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:#0f172a;color:#e2e8f0;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 4px}p.sub{color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 20px}.cards{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}.card{flex:1;background:#1e293b;border-radius:12px;padding:14px}.card .l{font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8}.card .v{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin-top:4px}.vin{color:#34d399}.vout{color:#f87171}.vbal{color:#38bdf8}form{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}input,select,button{padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #334155;background:#1e293b;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:14px}input[type=number]{width:110px}button.submit{background:#0ea5e9;border:none;color:#fff;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:16px}li{background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:8px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}li .nm{flex:1}li .tg{font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;background:#334155;border-radius:6px;padding:2px 8px}li .am.in{color:#34d399}li .am.out{color:#f87171}li .del{background:none;border:none;color:#64748b;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px}li .del:hover{color:#f87171}#msg{color:#f87171;font-size:12px;min-height:16px;margin:6px 0 0}</style></head><body><h1>💰 轻记账</h1><p class='sub'>v2：新增收支统计卡片，余额一目了然</p><div class='cards'><div class='card'><div class='l'>总收入</div><div class='v vin' id='ti'>¥0.00</div></div><div class='card'><div class='l'>总支出</div><div class='v vout' id='to'>¥0.00</div></div><div class='card'><div class='l'>结余</div><div class='v vbal' id='ba'>¥0.00</div></div></div><form onsubmit='return add(event)'><input id='n' placeholder='项目，如：午餐' maxlength='20' style='flex:1;min-width:140px'><input id='a' type='number' placeholder='金额' min='0.01' step='0.01'><select id='t'><option value='out'>支出</option><option value='in'>收入</option></select><button class='submit'>记一笔</button></form><p id='msg'></p><ul id='u'></ul><script>var r=[{n:'工资',a:8600,t:'in'},{n:'房租',a:2300,t:'out'},{n:'超市采购',a:186.5,t:'out'}];function add(e){e.preventDefault();var n=document.getElementById('n').value.trim(),a=parseFloat(document.getElementById('a').value);if(!n||!(a>0)){document.getElementById('msg').textContent='请填写项目名称并输入大于 0 的金额';return false}document.getElementById('msg').textContent='';r.unshift({n:n,a:a,t:document.getElementById('t').value});document.getElementById('n').value='';document.getElementById('a').value='';draw();return false}function draw(){var ti=0,to=0,u=document.getElementById('u');u.innerHTML='';r.forEach(function(x,i){if(x.t==='in')ti+=x.a;else to+=x.a;var li=document.createElement('li');var nm=document.createElement('span');nm.className='nm';nm.textContent=x.n;var tg=document.createElement('span');tg.className='tg';tg.textContent=x.t==='in'?'收入':'支出';var am=document.createElement('span');am.className='am '+x.t;am.textContent=(x.t==='in'?'+':'-')+'¥'+x.a.toFixed(2);var del=document.createElement('button');del.className='del';del.textContent='✕';del.onclick=function(){r.splice(i,1);draw()};li.appendChild(nm);li.appendChild(tg);li.appendChild(am);li.appendChild(del);u.appendChild(li)});document.getElementById('ti').textContent='¥'+ti.toFixed(2);document.getElementById('to').textContent='¥'+to.toFixed(2);document.getElementById('ba').textContent='¥'+(ti-to).toFixed(2)}draw();</script></body></html>",
